(a) World Wide Web (WWW) -> (i) Edward Jenner (1796)
(b) Smallpox Vaccine     -> (ii) Sir Tim Berners-Lee (1989)
(c) Penicillin           -> (iii) Alexander Graham Bell (1876)
(d) Telephone            -> (iv) Sir Alexander Fleming (1928)', 'WWW = Berners-Lee; Vaccine = Jenner; Penicillin = Fleming; Telephone = Bell.', NOW()) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
